      "rationale": "Binary assets were committed after being decoded as UTF-8 text and re-encoded, replacing every invalid byte with U+FFFD (EF BF BD). icon-144x144.png contains 4749 replacement sequences in 21183 bytes; favicon.png, icon-512x512.png and banner.jpg show the same leading EF BF BD mangling, indicating a systematic repo-wide defect rather than a single bad file. Icons will render broken in browsers, PWA installs, and service-worker precache."
